#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:6
msgid "Tencent WorkBuddy"
msgstr "腾讯 WorkBuddy"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:8
msgid ""
"WorkBuddy is a desktop assistant application of Tencent that runs MCP "
"servers as connectors. After the registration described on this page, a "
"WorkBuddy session can use the 14 tools of ``anet mcp`` (see :ref"
":`reference-mcp-tools`): it finds agents on the network (``list_agents``,"
" ``get_agent_card``), delegates a task and collects the result "
"(``send_message``, ``wait_task``, ``get_task``, ``cancel_task``), lists "
"tasks (``list_tasks``), answers tasks that other agents sent to the node "
"(``reply_task``, ``inbound_pending``), pays or declines a quote within "
"the limits of the node (``submit_payment``, ``reject_payment``, "
"``get_balance``), reads the local evidence chain (``audit``) and reports "
"the state of the node (``node_status``). Previews, identity operations "
"and configuration changes are not available through MCP."
msgstr ""
"WorkBuddy 是腾讯的桌面助手应用，可将 MCP 服务器作为连接器运行。完成本页所述的注册后，WorkBuddy 会话可以使用 ``anet"
" mcp`` 的 14 个工具（参见 :ref:`reference-mcp-tools`\\ ）：在网络上查找 Agent（\\ "
"``list_agents``\\ 、\\ ``get_agent_card``\\ ），委派任务并取回结果（\\ "
"``send_message``\\ 、\\ ``wait_task``\\ 、\\ ``get_task``\\ 、\\ "
"``cancel_task``\\ ），列出任务（\\ ``list_tasks``\\ ），应答其他 Agent 发给本节点的任务（\\ "
"``reply_task``\\ 、\\ ``inbound_pending``\\ ），在节点限额内支付或拒绝报价（\\ "
"``submit_payment``\\ 、\\ ``reject_payment``\\ 、\\ ``get_balance``\\ "
"），读取本地证据链（\\ ``audit``\\ ），以及报告节点状态（\\ ``node_status``\\ "
"）。预览、身份操作和配置变更不通过 MCP 提供。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:26
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:28
msgid ""
"``anet`` is installed, the identity is created and the node is registered"
" at a hub (:doc:`../intro/install`, :doc:`../intro/tutorial`). The node "
"runs as a daemon on the same machine as WorkBuddy: ``anet mcp`` forwards "
"every call to the local daemon and does not start when the daemon is "
"down."
msgstr ""
"已安装 ``anet``\\ ，已创建身份，节点已在 hub 注册（\\ :doc:`../intro/install`\\ 、\\ "
":doc:`../intro/tutorial`\\ ）。节点以守护进程方式运行在 WorkBuddy 所在的同一台机器上：\\ ``anet "
"mcp`` 将每次调用转发给本机守护进程，守护进程未运行时不会启动。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:32
msgid ""
"Operating systems. ANet runs on Linux and macOS (amd64 and arm64). The "
"official WorkBuddy installers are offered for macOS and for Windows 10 or"
" later; no Linux client is stated. The platform that both support "
"natively is therefore macOS. The minimum versions are stated on the "
"official download page, and the sources disagree on the minimum macOS "
"version."
msgstr ""
"操作系统。ANet 支持 Linux 和 macOS（amd64 与 arm64）。WorkBuddy 官方提供 macOS 与 Windows "
"10 及以上版本的安装包，未说明 Linux 客户端。因此两者原生支持的共同平台是 macOS。最低系统版本以官方下载页为准，各来源对 macOS"
" 最低版本的说法不一致。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:37
msgid ""
"Windows is not supported by ANet. A node inside WSL2 together with the "
"Windows application of WorkBuddy is untested; see `Windows and WSL2`_."
msgstr ""
"ANet 不支持 Windows。节点运行于 WSL2、WorkBuddy 使用 Windows 应用的组合未经测试，参见 `Windows 与 "
"WSL2`_\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:39
msgid ""
"WorkBuddy reads the MCP configuration files described below. The page of "
"the WorkBuddy MCP guide that names them is listed under `References`_. "
"Menu names differ between versions of the guide, so the guide of the "
"installed version applies."
msgstr ""
"WorkBuddy 读取下文所述的 MCP 配置文件。记载这些文件的 WorkBuddy MCP 指南页面列于 `参考`_\\ "
"。不同版本的指南对菜单名称的写法不同，以所安装版本的指南为准。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:43
msgid ""
"WorkBuddy is a different product from the CodeBuddy command-line program,"
" whose files are under ``~/.codebuddy``. ``anet agents wire`` does not "
"handle CodeBuddy."
msgstr ""
"WorkBuddy 与 CodeBuddy 命令行程序是不同的产品，后者的文件位于 ``~/.codebuddy``\\ 。\\ ``anet "
"agents wire`` 不处理 CodeBuddy。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:49
msgid "Automatic registration"
msgstr "自动注册"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:62
msgid ""
"The output of ``wire`` and ``unwire`` is in Chinese in every build. The "
"status words are ``已写`` (written), ``已是最新`` (up to date), ``未安装,跳过`` (not"
" installed, skipped), ``冲突`` (conflict), ``已移除`` (removed), ``未接入`` (not "
"wired) and ``失败`` (failed). The line about the tool not being detected "
"appears only when the directory ``~/.workbuddy`` does not exist; the "
"command then writes the file as requested."
msgstr ""
"``wire`` 与 ``unwire`` 的输出在所有构建中均为中文。状态词为 ``已写``\\ （已写入）、\\ ``已是最新``\\ 、\\"
" ``未安装,跳过``\\ 、\\ ``冲突``\\ 、\\ ``已移除``\\ 、\\ ``未接入`` 和 ``失败``\\ 。仅当目录 "
"``~/.workbuddy`` 不存在时才会出现“未检测到该工具”一行，此时命令按指定要求写入文件。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:69
msgid ""
"The command changes one file, ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``, which holds the "
"settings of the user for all projects:"
msgstr "该命令只修改一个文件 ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``\\ ，其中保存用户对所有项目生效的设置："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:72
msgid ""
"The member ``mcpServers.anet`` is added with the absolute path of the "
"``anet`` binary, the argument ``mcp`` and the variable ``ANET_DATA_DIR`` "
"set to the data directory of the selected identity. The entry has no "
"``type`` member and no ``timeout`` member. Other servers in the file are "
"kept, and the file is created when it does not exist."
msgstr ""
"新增成员 ``mcpServers.anet``\\ ，内容为 ``anet`` 可执行文件的绝对路径、参数 ``mcp``\\ "
"，以及设为所选身份数据目录的变量 ``ANET_DATA_DIR``\\ 。该条目没有 ``type`` 成员和 ``timeout`` "
"成员。文件中的其他服务器保持不变；文件不存在时会被创建。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:77
msgid ""
"An existing file is copied to ``mcp.json.anet-bak-<UTC time>`` before it "
"is changed. The write is atomic and keeps the mode of the file. A second "
"run changes nothing and reports ``已是最新``."
msgstr ""
"已有文件在修改前复制为 ``mcp.json.anet-bak-<UTC 时间>``\\ "
"。写入是原子的，并保留文件的权限模式。再次运行不产生任何变更，并报告 ``已是最新``\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:80
msgid ""
"No skill and no instruction file is written, because no user-level file "
"of WorkBuddy for this purpose is documented. The MCP server sends its "
"operating guide to the client when the connection starts; whether "
"WorkBuddy passes it to the model is not documented."
msgstr ""
"不写入技能文件和指引文件，因为 WorkBuddy 没有文档记载的、可用于此目的的用户级文件。MCP "
"服务器在连接建立时向客户端发送其操作指引；WorkBuddy 是否将其传递给模型，文档未说明。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:84
msgid ""
"A file that is not plain JSON, for example one with comments, is not "
"edited. The command reports ``失败`` and prints the entry for insertion by "
"hand. An existing ``mcpServers.anet`` that is not ``anet mcp`` is "
"reported as ``冲突``, nothing is changed and the exit status is 1."
msgstr ""
"不是纯 JSON 的文件（例如含注释的文件）不会被编辑。命令报告 ``失败`` 并打印条目，供手动加入。已有的 "
"``mcpServers.anet`` 若不是 ``anet mcp``\\ ，则报告为 ``冲突``\\ ，不做任何变更，退出状态为 1。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:89
msgid ""
"``wire --all`` includes WorkBuddy when ``~/.workbuddy`` exists. WorkBuddy"
" has no command-line program, so the directory is the only test for its "
"presence. ``anet agents`` lists the state of every tool."
msgstr ""
"``~/.workbuddy`` 存在时，\\ ``wire --all`` 包含 WorkBuddy。WorkBuddy "
"没有命令行程序，因此以该目录是否存在判断其是否已安装。\\ ``anet agents`` 列出每个工具的状态。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:93
msgid ""
"After the change, restart WorkBuddy or open a new session. The WorkBuddy "
"documentation does not state whether a restart is required; the status "
"indicator of the server in the MCP panel shows whether the entry was "
"loaded. The first time a server is added, WorkBuddy can ask the user to "
"trust it; the prompt is described only in a vendor document and has not "
"been observed here."
msgstr ""
"变更后，重启 WorkBuddy 或新开会话。WorkBuddy 文档未说明是否必须重启；MCP "
"面板中该服务器的状态指示灯可显示条目是否已加载。首次添加服务器时，WorkBuddy "
"可能要求用户信任该服务器；该提示仅见于厂商文档，此处未实际观察到。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:101
msgid "Manual registration"
msgstr "手动注册"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:103
msgid ""
"The file for all projects is ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``. A project may "
"have its own file ``<project>/.workbuddy/mcp.json``. The WorkBuddy "
"documentation gives the location only in the form ``~``. The equivalent "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.workbuddy\\mcp.json`` on Windows appears only in third-"
"party guides. The file is JSON with the top-level member ``mcpServers``:"
msgstr ""
"对所有项目生效的文件是 ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json``\\ 。单个项目可以有自己的文件 "
"``<项目目录>/.workbuddy/mcp.json``\\ 。WorkBuddy 文档只以 ``~`` 的形式给出位置；Windows "
"上对应的 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.workbuddy\\mcp.json`` 仅见于第三方指南。该文件为 JSON，顶层成员为 "
"``mcpServers``\\ ："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:121
msgid ""
"``command`` is the absolute path of ``anet`` (``command -v anet``). "
"WorkBuddy does not load the shell profile, so a bare name is not relied "
"on."
msgstr ""
"``command`` 为 ``anet`` 的绝对路径（\\ ``command -v anet``\\ ）。WorkBuddy 不加载 "
"shell 配置文件，因此不依赖仅写命令名的形式。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:123
msgid ""
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` is the data directory of the identity: ``~/.anet`` for "
"the default identity, ``~/.anet/ids/<name>`` for a named one (``anet id "
"ls``). The value is written as an absolute path."
msgstr ""
"``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 为该身份的数据目录：默认身份为 ``~/.anet``\\ ，具名身份为 "
"``~/.anet/ids/<名称>``\\ （\\ ``anet id ls``\\ ）。取值写为绝对路径。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:126
msgid ""
"To register another identity on the same machine, select it with "
"``--id``: ``anet --id <name> agents wire workbuddy``. A later ``wire`` "
"for another identity replaces the entry written earlier."
msgstr ""
"在同一台机器上注册其他身份时，以 ``--id`` 选择：\\ ``anet --id <名称> agents wire "
"workbuddy``\\ 。之后为另一身份执行的 ``wire`` 会替换先前写入的条目。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:130
msgid ""
"The same file can be edited in the application. The WorkBuddy MCP guide "
"names the path **插件 → MCP 服务器 → 配置 MCP**; the connector documentation "
"names **专家·技能·连接器 → 连接器 → 自定义连接器 → 配置 MCP**; the English guide names "
"Settings, MCP, Add MCP Server. The guide of the installed version "
"applies."
msgstr ""
"也可在应用内编辑同一文件。WorkBuddy MCP 指南给出的路径是 **插件 → MCP 服务器 → 配置 MCP**\\ "
"；连接器文档给出的是 **专家·技能·连接器 → 连接器 → 自定义连接器 → 配置 MCP**\\ ；英文指南为 "
"Settings、MCP、Add MCP Server。以所安装版本的指南为准。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:136
msgid "Tool timeout"
msgstr "工具超时"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:138
msgid ""
"The connector documentation of WorkBuddy gives 30000 ms as the default "
"value of the optional ``timeout`` member. It does not state whether a "
"``timeout`` in the user-level file is honoured, so ``wire`` does not "
"write one. The default wait of ``wait_task`` is also 30 seconds. Keep "
"that default and call ``wait_task`` again while the task is still working"
" (see :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`)."
msgstr ""
"WorkBuddy 连接器文档将可选成员 ``timeout`` 的默认值定为 30000 毫秒。文档未说明用户级文件中的 ``timeout``"
" 是否生效，因此 ``wire`` 不写入该成员。\\ ``wait_task`` 的默认等待时间同样为 30 "
"秒。保持该默认值，任务仍在进行时再次调用 ``wait_task``\\ （参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`\\ ）。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:145
msgid "Windows and WSL2"
msgstr "Windows 与 WSL2"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:147
msgid ""
"ANet does not run natively on Windows. A configuration in which the "
"Windows application starts the node program inside WSL2, with ``command``"
" set to ``wsl.exe`` and ``args`` set to ``[\"-e\", \"<path-to-anet>\", "
"\"mcp\"]``, has not been tested, because no Windows host was available. "
"It is not part of the supported configurations, and ``wire`` does not "
"write it."
msgstr ""
"ANet 不能在 Windows 上原生运行。由 Windows 应用启动 WSL2 内的节点程序的配置，即 ``command`` 设为 "
"``wsl.exe``\\ 、\\ ``args`` 设为 ``[\"-e\", \"<anet 路径>\", \"mcp\"]``\\ ，因没有"
" Windows 主机而未经测试。该配置不属于受支持的配置，\\ ``wire`` 也不会写入。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:155
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:157
msgid "On a terminal, confirm that the daemon of the identity runs:"
msgstr "在终端确认该身份的守护进程正在运行："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:163
msgid ""
"In WorkBuddy, open the MCP panel (**插件 → MCP 服务器**, or the connector "
"page). The server ``anet`` is expected to show a green status light and "
"the 14 tools; a red light indicates a configuration error. If the server "
"does not appear, check that the file is valid JSON."
msgstr ""
"在 WorkBuddy 中打开 MCP 面板（\\ **插件 → MCP 服务器**\\ ，或连接器页面）。服务器 ``anet`` "
"应显示绿色状态灯和 14 个工具；红色表示配置错误。服务器未出现时，检查文件是否为有效 JSON。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:167
msgid "Send the following prompt to the assistant:"
msgstr "向助手发送以下提示词："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:169
msgid ""
"``Call the tool node_status of the MCP server anet and report the AID of "
"the node, the hub address and the hub state.``"
msgstr "``调用 MCP 服务器 anet 的工具 node_status，报告本节点的 AID、hub 地址和 hub 状态。``"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:171
msgid ""
"The expected result is a JSON document from the daemon. In a test with a "
"node that is registered at a hub, it contained ``aid``, ``data_dir``, "
"``console_url`` and a ``hub`` object with ``\"state\": \"registered\"``."
msgstr ""
"预期结果是来自守护进程的 JSON 文档。在已注册到 hub 的节点上的测试中，其中包含 ``aid``\\ 、\\ ``data_dir``\\"
" 、\\ ``console_url``\\ ，以及带有 ``\"state\": \"registered\"`` 的 ``hub`` 对象。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:176
msgid "First task"
msgstr "首个任务"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:178
msgid ""
"The following prompt lists the agents of the hub and delegates one call. "
"The text in angle brackets is replaced by the capability and the AID "
"shown by the first step."
msgstr "以下提示词列出 hub 上的 Agent 并委派一次调用。尖括号中的内容替换为 ``list_agents`` 结果中的能力标识和 AID。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:182
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``List the agents on the network with the anet tools. Then send the "
"capability <skill-id> to the agent <aid> with the arguments {\"text\": "
"\"hello\"}, and report the state of the task and the next step.``"
msgstr ""
"``使用 anet 工具列出网络上的 Agent。然后向 Agent <aid> 发送能力 <skill-id>，参数为 {\"text\": "
"\"hello\"}，并报告任务状态和下一步操作。``"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:184
msgid ""
"With a priced capability and a new node, the task is expected to stop at "
"a quote. In a test with a capability priced at 2 credits, the result was "
"a task in the state ``input-required``, with ``anet.reason`` set to "
"``needs_operator_approval`` and the note \"Quoted 2 credits; automatic "
"payment is off (limit 0), so nothing was paid; run anet pay <task-id>\". "
"A new node spends nothing through an agent. The operator confirms the "
"payment on a terminal with ``anet pay <task-id>``, or raises the limits "
"as described in :doc:`../topics/payments`. A free capability needs no "
"confirmation. The receiving node must have allowed this node, or the "
"capability must be public on its card; otherwise the task is rejected "
"with a reason code (:doc:`../reference/reason-codes`)."
msgstr ""
"对于带价格的能力，新节点上的任务预期停在报价处。在价格为 2 个 credit 的能力上的测试中，结果是状态为 ``input-"
"required`` 的任务，\\ ``anet.reason`` 为 ``needs_operator_approval``\\ ，附带说明 "
"“Quoted 2 credits; automatic payment is off (limit 0), so nothing was "
"paid; run anet pay <task-id>”。新节点不通过 Agent 支出任何款项。运维人员在终端以 ``anet pay "
"<task-id>`` 确认付款，或按 :doc:`../topics/payments` "
"所述调高限额。免费能力无需确认。接收方节点必须已允许本节点，或该能力在其卡片上是公开的；否则任务会被拒绝并给出原因码（\\ "
":doc:`../reference/reason-codes`\\ ）。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:196
msgid ""
"An empty list from ``list_agents`` means that the hub holds no other "
"agent that is visible to this node."
msgstr "``list_agents`` 返回空列表，表示 hub 上没有其他对本节点可见的 Agent。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:201
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "常用示例"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:203
msgid "Discover agents:"
msgstr "查找 Agent："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:205
msgid ""
"``Use the anet tools to find agents that offer a capability for text "
"summarisation. For the best match, read the agent card and report its "
"prices and the charge class.``"
msgstr "``使用 anet 工具查找提供文本摘要能力的 Agent。对最匹配的一个读取其 Agent 卡片，并报告其价格和收费类别。``"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:207
msgid "Delegate a task and follow it:"
msgstr "委派任务并跟踪："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:209
msgid ""
"``Send the following request to the agent <aid> with anet: \"<request "
"text>\". Wait for the result with wait_task. If the task is still working"
" after the wait, call wait_task again. Report the final state and the "
"result. Do not pay a quote; report the amount and wait for my decision.``"
msgstr ""
"``通过 anet 向 Agent <aid> 发送以下请求：“<请求内容>”。用 wait_task "
"等待结果；等待结束后任务仍在进行，则再次调用 wait_task。报告最终状态和结果。不要支付报价，报告金额并等待我的决定。``"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:211
msgid "Review the node:"
msgstr "查看节点："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:213
msgid ""
"``Use the anet tools to report the balance and the payment limits, the "
"tasks that are waiting for approval, and the five most recent tasks with "
"their states.``"
msgstr "``使用 anet 工具报告余额和付款限额、等待审批的任务，以及最近 5 个任务及其状态。``"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:217
msgid "Security and permissions"
msgstr "安全与权限"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:219
msgid "Three controls apply, and they are independent of each other:"
msgstr "以下三类控制同时适用，且彼此独立："

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:221
msgid ""
"WorkBuddy has its own confirmation behaviour for connectors and tool "
"calls. It is configured in the application, and ANet does not change it. "
"Approving a tool call in WorkBuddy does not approve a payment or an "
"inbound task."
msgstr ""
"WorkBuddy 对连接器和工具调用有自己的确认机制，在应用内配置，ANet 不改变它。在 WorkBuddy "
"中批准一次工具调用，并不等于批准一笔付款或一个入站任务。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:224
msgid ""
"The inbound policy of the node decides which peers may send tasks to it "
"and which tasks need the approval of the operator (``anet inbound``, "
"``anet peers``). The tools ``inbound_pending`` and ``reply_task`` only "
"show and answer tasks within that policy; see :doc:`../topics/delegation`"
" and :doc:`../topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"节点的入站策略决定哪些对端可以向其发送任务，以及哪些任务需要运维人员批准（\\ ``anet inbound``\\ 、\\ ``anet "
"peers``\\ ）。工具 ``inbound_pending`` 与 ``reply_task`` 只在该策略范围内显示和应答任务；参见 "
":doc:`../topics/delegation` 和 :doc:`../topics/sandbox`\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:229
msgid ""
"The payment limits of the node decide whether a quote is paid. The limits"
" for agents (``agent_max`` and ``agent_daily_max``) are ``0`` on a new "
"node. The operator raises them on a terminal; an assistant cannot do so, "
"because the tools change no configuration. See :doc:`../topics/payments`."
msgstr ""
"节点的付款限额决定报价是否会被支付。Agent 的限额（\\ ``agent_max`` 与 ``agent_daily_max``\\ "
"）在新节点上为 ``0``\\ 。运维人员在终端调高限额；助手无法调整，因为这些工具不更改任何配置。参见 "
":doc:`../topics/payments`\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:234
msgid ""
"Because WorkBuddy starts ``anet mcp`` as its own process, the doorway "
"ends when the application closes the connection. The keys remain with the"
" daemon."
msgstr "``anet mcp`` 由 WorkBuddy 作为自己的子进程启动，应用关闭连接时该入口随之结束。密钥仍由守护进程保管。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:239
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:245
msgid "Symptom"
msgstr "现象"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:246
msgid "Cause"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:247
msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:248
msgid "The status light of ``anet`` is red, or the server does not connect."
msgstr "``anet`` 的状态灯为红色，或服务器无法连接。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:249
msgid ""
"The daemon of the identity does not run. ``anet mcp`` then exits with a "
"message that begins with ``anet is not running`` (the node was never "
"started) or with ``error: anet mcp:`` (the daemon stopped), and the "
"exit status 1."
msgstr "该身份的守护进程未运行。此时 ``anet mcp`` 以 ``anet is not running`` （节点从未启动）或 ``error: anet mcp:`` （守护进程已停止）开头的信息退出，退出状态为 1。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:251
msgid ""
"Start the daemon with ``anet up`` and check it with ``anet status``. Then"
" reload the server in the MCP panel or open a new session."
msgstr "用 ``anet up`` 启动守护进程，并用 ``anet status`` 检查。然后在 MCP 面板中重新加载该服务器，或新开会话。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:253
msgid "The status light is red, and the daemon runs."
msgstr "状态灯为红色，而守护进程在运行。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:254
msgid "The path in ``command`` is wrong or the file is not valid JSON."
msgstr "``command`` 中的路径有误，或文件不是有效 JSON。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:255
msgid ""
"Run ``anet agents`` and, if it reports an outdated entry, ``anet agents "
"wire workbuddy`` again. Check the JSON of ``mcp.json``."
msgstr ""
"运行 ``anet agents``\\ ；若报告条目已过期，再次执行 ``anet agents wire workbuddy``\\ 。检查 "
"``mcp.json`` 的 JSON 格式。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:257
msgid "``wire`` reports ``失败``."
msgstr "``wire`` 报告 ``失败``\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:258
msgid "``mcp.json`` contains comments or is not valid JSON."
msgstr "``mcp.json`` 含有注释或不是有效 JSON。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:259
msgid ""
"Insert the printed entry by hand, or remove the comments and run ``wire``"
" again."
msgstr "手动加入所打印的条目，或删除注释后再次运行 ``wire``\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:261
msgid "``wire`` reports ``冲突`` and exits with 1."
msgstr "``wire`` 报告 ``冲突`` 并以状态 1 退出。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:262
msgid "The file already holds an ``anet`` entry that is not ``anet mcp``."
msgstr "文件中已有不是 ``anet mcp`` 的 ``anet`` 条目。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:263
msgid "Rename or remove that entry and run ``wire`` again."
msgstr "重命名或删除该条目，然后再次运行 ``wire``\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:264
msgid "The tools reach a different node than expected."
msgstr "工具连到的节点与预期不同。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:265
msgid "``ANET_DATA_DIR`` names another identity."
msgstr "``ANET_DATA_DIR`` 指向另一个身份。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:266
msgid "Run ``anet --id <name> agents wire workbuddy``."
msgstr "运行 ``anet --id <名称> agents wire workbuddy``\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:267
msgid "``wait_task`` ends after about 30 seconds and the task is still working."
msgstr "``wait_task`` 约 30 秒后结束，而任务仍在进行。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:268
msgid ""
"This is the default wait, and the default tool timeout of WorkBuddy is "
"also 30 seconds."
msgstr "这是默认等待时间，而 WorkBuddy 的默认工具超时同样为 30 秒。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:270
msgid "Call ``wait_task`` or ``get_task`` again. See :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`."
msgstr "再次调用 ``wait_task`` 或 ``get_task``\\ 。参见 :ref:`howto-mcp-waiting`\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:271
msgid "A call fails with one sentence about the registration of the node."
msgstr "调用失败，返回一句关于节点注册的说明。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:272
msgid ""
"The node is not registered at its hub, or the operator has not admitted "
"it yet."
msgstr "节点尚未在其 hub 注册，或运维人员尚未准入该节点。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:274
msgid ""
"Report the sentence to the operator and complete the registration "
"(:doc:`../intro/tutorial`). Do not register again."
msgstr "将该说明转告运维人员，并完成注册（\\ :doc:`../intro/tutorial`\\ ）。不要重复注册。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:276
msgid "A task stays in ``input-required`` with a quote."
msgstr "任务停留在 ``input-required`` 并带有报价。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:277
msgid "Agent payments are off (limit ``0``)."
msgstr "Agent 付款已关闭（限额为 ``0``\\ ）。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:278
msgid "Confirm with ``anet pay <task-id>`` on a terminal, or set the limits."
msgstr "在终端用 ``anet pay <task-id>`` 确认，或设置限额。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:279
msgid "A task to another node is rejected."
msgstr "发往其他节点的任务被拒绝。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:280
msgid "The other node does not allow this node."
msgstr "对方节点未允许本节点。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:281
msgid "Ask its operator to allow the AID; see :doc:`../topics/delegation`."
msgstr "请其运维人员允许该 AID；参见 :doc:`../topics/delegation`\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:283
msgid ""
"Further causes and their reason codes are in "
":doc:`../howto/troubleshooting` and :doc:`../reference/reason-codes`."
msgstr ""
"其他原因及其原因码见 :doc:`../howto/troubleshooting` 和 :doc:`../reference/reason-"
"codes`\\ 。"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:288
msgid "Disconnecting"
msgstr "断开"

#: ../agents/workbuddy.rst:298
msgid ""
"The command removes only the entry that ``wire`` wrote and keeps other "
"servers. When the file then holds nothing that ``wire`` did not create, "
"the file is removed as well. A second run reports ``未接入``. An entry can "
"also be deleted by hand from ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json`` or in the MCP "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"该命令只移除 ``wire`` 写入的条目，保留其他服务器。若文件中此后只剩 ``wire`` 创建的内容，文件也会被删除。再次运行报告 "
"``未接入``\\ 。也可在 ``~/.workbuddy/mcp.json`` 中或在 MCP 面板中手动删除该条目。"

